# The client's leaf-based OTA compares sha256 of bundled assets against this
# repo's raw.githubusercontent.com content. Line endings must therefore be
# identical everywhere (LF), including Windows checkouts of the submodule.
*.json text eol=lf
*.svg text eol=lf
*.dart text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.gitkeep text eol=lf
